# Krang, Utrom Warlord: "Flying, trample, indestructible, haste." Cast on turn 3 off Black Lotus, five Moxes and a
# Forest, it attacks at once (haste). Only Bot2's Endurance, which has reach, can block a flyer; Krang assigns it
# lethal damage and tramples the other 5 over to Bot2 (CR 702.19b), and takes Endurance's 3 in return.

